    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barbariatab werikab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiibutyi barbariatab lagokab Josep Jordan eng’ Jeriko, eng’ beekab Jeriko eng’ kong’asis, ne ong’atet, kotogosta eng’ Jeriko kobun emetab tulonok kwo Bet-el; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiwa komanda eng’ Bet-el kwo Lus, ak kwo kosiirto kot koit kiwotetab Arikik agoi Atarot; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kwo kochortagei kotokyigei cherongo agoi kiwotetab Japletik, kot koit kiwotetab Bet-horon eng’ komosta ne rektoot, kot koit Geser; ak kimong’ji kiwotennyi nyanjet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam lagokab Josep, che ki Manase ak Eprain, borotenywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ki u ni kiwotetab lagokab Epraim, ko u ortinwekwak: ak kiwotetab borotenywa ne kitokyingei kong’asis ko ki Atarotadar, kot koit Bet-horon barak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiwa kiwotet kotokyingei cherongo eng’ Mikmetat eng’ murot ne bo katam; ak kiyiemak kiwotet kotokyigei kong’asis kot koit Taanat-silo, ak kobun yoto eng’ kong’asis ne bo Janoa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kichortagei eng’ Janoa kwo Atarot, agoi Nara, kot koit Jeriko, ak komanda eng’ Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwa kiwotet kong’eete Tapua kobun cherongo kot koit ainetab Kana; ak kimong’ji kiwotennyi nyanjet. Nito ko borotetab bororietab lagokab Epraim ko u ortinwekwak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koboto nganasok che kigitabanji lagokab Epraim eng’ kwenutab borotetab lagokab Manase, nganasok tugul koboto nganasokwak che mengechen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ma on Kanaik che kimenyei Geser: ago kimeny Kananik kwenutab Epraim, agoi rani, ak kiek otwogik che yaei boisionikab otwoknatet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
